    "urlText": "Rose Bay Wharf closure for maintenance",
    "url": "https://transportnsw.info/alerts/details#/ems-46939",
    "content": "<div><strong>Monday 17 to Friday 21 February</strong></div>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Daily from 9.30am to 3.30pm</strong>, Rose Bay Wharf will be closed temporarily for maintenance.</li>\n<li>For travel to the city, use local bus services from New South Head Road or trains at Edgecliff Station.</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://transportnsw.info/trip#/trip\">Plan your trip</a> for real time, up-to-date information.</li>\n</ul>",
    "subtitle": "Rose Bay Wharf closure for maintenance",
    "properties": {
      "smsText": "Rose Bay Wharf closure for maintenance",
      "speechText": "Monday 17 to Friday 21 February\nDaily from 9:30AM to 3:30PM, Rose Bay Wharf will be closed temporarily for maintenance.\nFor travel to the city, use local bus services from New South Head Road or trains at Edgecliff Station.\nPlan your trip at transportnsw.info for real time, up-to-date information.",
