    "urlText": "Darlinghurst bus diversions for Sydney Streets event",
    "url": "https://transportnsw.info/alerts/details#/ems-46934",
    "content": "<div>From 8am until 11.30pm on Saturday 22 February, route 389 services will be diverting and missing stops while road closures are in place for a City of Sydney&rsquo;s Sydney Streets event on Stanley St in Darlinghurst.</div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div>Services towards Pyrmont will be diverting via Crown St. Services towards Bondi Junction will be diverting via Riley St, Sir John Young Cres and Crown St. Allow extra travel time and check signs at bus stops for alternative stop locations.&nbsp;</div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div><strong>Stops missed:</strong></div>\n<ul>\n<li>Yurong St after William St. (201070)</li>\n<li>Stanley St at Crown St. (201071)</li>\n</ul>",
    "subtitle": "Darlinghurst bus diversions for Sydney Streets event",
    "properties": {
      "smsText": "Darlinghurst bus diversions for Sydney Streets event",
      "speechText": "From 8 AM until 11 30 PM on Saturday 22 February, route 3 8 9 services will be diverting and missing stops while road closures are in place for a City of Sydney’s Sydney Streets event on Stanley St in Darlinghurst.",
      "announcementType": "serviceChange",
      "publishToAreas": "1",
      "providerCode": "TfNSW"
    },
    "affected": {
      "lines": [
